                        <div class="feature-bullet"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span> Up to 20 versions stored per prompt</div>
                        <div class="feature-bullet"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span> Preview each version before restoring</div>
                        <div class="feature-bullet"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span> Timestamped snapshots for full audit trail</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
