            <div class="editor-header"><div><h2 id="modalTitle">New Prompt</h2><p>Create and organise your AI prompt with variables, labels, and chains</p></div><button type="button" class="modal-close-x" id="closePromptModal" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-left:12px"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span></button></div>
